<title>SWEDEN: Stena Line H1 losses mount 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Stena Line H1 losses mount 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items	     560  vs     350</p>
<p> Turnover				   3,971  vs   4,271</p>
<p> Operating costs			  4,028  vs   4,125</p>
<p> Restructuring costs			 10  vs     13</p>
<p> Depreciation				 309  vs    293</p>
<p> Profit after depreciation		376  vs    160</p>
<p> Financial income			    15  vs     22</p>
<p> Financial costs			    199  vs    210</p>
<p> Currency exchange effects		  0  vs	2  CHARGE</p>
<p> Net financial items	    CHARGE  184  vs    190  CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax charge				   155  vs    102</p>
<p> Net loss				     405  vs    248</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full company name of ferry operator is Stena Line AB.</p>
